      "text": "abominable church takes away parts of gospel to pervert right ways of the Lord, 1 Ne. 13:27 (22:14). words of Nephi1 are sufficient to teach any man right way to believe in Christ, 2 Ne. 25:28. Sherem claims Jacob2 has led away many, that they pervert right way of God, Jacob 7:7. Sherem claims law of Moses is right way, Jacob 7:7. he to whom kingdom rightly belongs has refused it, Mosiah 29:6. whosoever shall smite thee on right cheek, turn to him other, 3 Ne. 12:39 (Matt. 5:39). those baptized are nourished by good word of God, to keep them in right way, Moro. 6:4.",
